<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="heading-title">退款申请</view><view class="subtitle">仅退原批次可用、未冻结的权益。</view><view class="note" style="margin-top:25rpx">退款按可退注数、原购买单价及后端政策快照计算。申请后立即冻结，审核与付款留待平台处理。已发顾客权益不收回。</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{orders.length}}"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">原购买订单</text><picker range="{{orders}}" range-key="id" value="{{orderIndex||0}}" bindchange="orderChange"><view class="picker">{{form.orderId}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">退款注数</text><input value="{{form.quantity}}" type="number" bindinput="input" data-field="quantity"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">申请原因</text><textarea value="{{form.reason}}" bindinput="input" data-field="reason" placeholder="请填写具体原因"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="submitRefund" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认申请并冻结</button></view><view wx:else class="empty"><view class="title">暂无可选购买订单</view><view class="desc">完成模拟采购后即可体验原批次退款</view></view><view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">退款进度</text></view><view class="card record" wx:for="{{refunds}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="status">{{labels[item.status]}}</text></view><view class="amount">¥ {{item.refundAmount}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.betCount}}注 · 比例快照 {{item.refundRate}} · 政策v{{item.policyVersion}}</view><view class="id">{{item.purchaseOrderId}}</view></view></block></view>